# ⚙️ Installation

Clone repository:

```
git clone https://github.com/C0de-With-Nikhil/CODEAOIS_PROJECT.git
```

Go to project folder:

```
cd CODEAOIS_PROJECT
```

Create virtual environment:

```
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
```

Install dependencies:

```
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Run CodeAOIS:

```
python app.py
```

